OP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"631\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"228\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 21pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0.8pt\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 공모기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2011. 3. 1. ~ 6. 30.(4개월간)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0.8pt\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 대 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;상 : 대한민국 국민 누구나</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0.8pt\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 공모형식 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">논문형식(A4 15매 내외 - 별첨서식)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0.8pt\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 공모분야 : 거창의 군정 및 지역 발전과 관련한 전 분야</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0.8pt\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 응모방법 : 우편, 이메일, 팩스 등</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0.8pt\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 심 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;사 : 별도 심사위원회 구성 후 거창군 제안제도 운영조례에 따라 심사</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0.8pt\" align=\"justify\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;□ 시 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;상 : 최우수1명(3,000천원), 우수2명(2,000천원), 장려3명(500천원)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 0.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">붙임 &nbsp;1. 홍보 포스터 1부.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 거창발전논문 공고문 1부.<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 논문 공모 제안서식 1부. &nbsp;끝.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
